{"id":"101131","name":"香菇剁椒香辣酱","author":"胡桐小橘子","authorId":"6092753","desc":"","cover":"images/101131/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"香菇","amount":"适量"},{"name":"剁椒","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"花生","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"香菇适量","img":"images/101131/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"洗净","img":"images/101131/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"把水挤出来","img":"images/101131/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"香菇剁成碎","img":"images/101131/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅中放三大勺油，小火烧热","img":"images/101131/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"下香菇碎，小火炒制","img":"images/101131/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"剁椒一瓶备用","img":"images/101131/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"香菇炒出香味时下剁椒，一瓶都倒进去。","img":"images/101131/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"翻炒均匀加适量盐【剁椒本就是咸的】","img":"images/101131/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"花生适量，剁碎","img":"images/101131/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加入锅里翻炒","img":"images/101131/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"翻炒均匀后加酱油","img":"images/101131/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"加白糖适量【我放了一大勺，多一点能缓和辣度】","img":"images/101131/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"加白糖两分钟后加鸡精","img":"images/101131/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"最后大火收汁就行了","img":"images/101131/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"很香很辣很爽","img":"images/101131/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"炒制期间要小火，而且要一直不停的翻炒防止糊锅。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}